<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Gehrig returns two weeks after his first visit and is seen the same day by Dr. Nakamura of neuromuscular neurology, who performed EMG and nerve conduction studies this morning. The MRI of the brain and cervical spine a week ago was normal. Since the first visit he has had no new symptoms but feels his grip is a little weaker; he has kept to walking and stretching and has not played or lifted. He has no trouble speaking, swallowing or breathing. He asked to hear the results himself first, and plainly. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tests</td><td>EMG and nerve conduction studies this morning; MRI of the brain and cervical spine a week ago</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Grip slightly weaker; cramps; no speech, swallowing or breathing symptoms</td></tr><tr><td>Activity</td><td>Not playing or lifting; walking and stretching</td></tr><tr><td>His request</td><td>Results to him first, plainly</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

